---
title: "The busy state of one Game"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Idle
    lg1: Busy
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 blue
  s0: Idle
  s1: A run holds it, between two Jobs
  s2: A Job holds it
  s3: A run holds it, its Job runs
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you start Autoplay
  s0 --> s2: you send an Action
  s1 --> s0: the run's accept cannot read the story or you press Stop or the run ends or the run's budget is spent
  s1 --> s3: the run starts its next Job
  s2 --> s0: you press Stop or the Job ends
  s3 --> s0: you press Stop
  s3 --> s1: the Job ends
  class s0 teal
  class s1 blue
  class s2 blue
  class s3 blue
